            <ArticleTitle>Automated human avatar synthesis for obesity control using low-cost depth cameras.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>36-42</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this paper a framework is presented for monitoring shape changes on the human body with applications to obesity control. This framework uses a low-cost infrared depth camera in order to capture the 3D shape of the human body and approximate it as a set of spherical functions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
